# Invented tasks of a demo project, for quoted column names: no real project, team or person.
recipe sheet-headers
  | Names its columns the way a synced sheet's headers are written, accents and blanks kept.

compose "Última Sync"={due|slug}
group by=team,"Última Sync" into="Tarefas do Time"
count "Tarefas do Time" into="Nº de Tarefas"
select team, "Última Sync", "Nº de Tarefas"
test.sheet
